  "remarks": "LLC Gazprom Flot is a leading company in the Russian energy sector. The company is involved in drilling services related to the production of oil and gas, as well as transportation and regasification of LNG, construction and operation of floating drilling rigs and specialised vessels. The energy sector, especially the oil and gas sectors, provides a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation.",
